# Budget Planner – .gitignore
#
# PRIVACY: this repo is meant to be PUBLIC. Private notes must never get in.
# This file is an ALLOWLIST: everything is ignored unless it is listed
# below with a "!" in front.
#
# - New code goes in src/ (already allowed).
# - To share a new top-level file, add a "!/filename" line.
# - Before every commit, check what Git sees:  git status --short --ignored
# - Never use "git add -f" (it skips this file's protection).

# 1. Ignore everything at the top level of this folder.
/*

# 2. Allow only the plugin's code and config files.
!/.gitignore
!/.editorconfig
!/.npmrc
!/src/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/manifest.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/esbuild.config.mjs
!/eslint.config.mts
!/version-bump.mjs
!/versions.json
!/styles.css

# 3. Never these, anywhere, even inside allowed folders.
# Notes and other Obsidian files (only README.md is allowed).
# Not shared on purpose (decided 2026-11-05): AGENTS.md and .github/ (not needed by the plugin).
*.md
!/README.md
*.canvas
*.base
*.excalidraw
.obsidian/
# Claude's project instructions (personal setup details) – decided 2026-11-04: never shared.
CLAUDE.md
# Plugin settings, backups, secrets, editor and Claude settings.
data.json
*.bak
.env
.env.*
.claude/
.vscode/
